---
const connections = [
  { from: 'Your model', to: 'The weights, context length, and memory it needs.' },
  { from: 'Your hardware', to: 'The GPU, CPU, and memory available to run it.' },
  { from: 'Your workload', to: 'Interactive replies, longer prompts, or work waiting in a queue.' },
];
---
<section class="system-section container" id="system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
  <div class="system-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">The system</p>
    <h2 id="system-title">A model host that<br />knows its limits.</h2>
    <p class="system-description">Local hosting brings the model, machine, and workload together. The settings need to make sense for all three.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="system-story">
    <p class="story-lead">A longer prompt needs more memory. More requests compete for the same resources. Yesterday's settings may not fit today's work.</p>
    <p class="story-body">strided is designed to host local models and <strong class="strided-emphasis">adjust how they run.</strong> It will use the machine's available resources and live workload signals to choose runtime settings within the limits you set.</p>
    <dl class="connections">
      {connections.map(item => <div><dt>{item.from}</dt><dd>{item.to}</dd></div>)}
    </dl>
    <p class="scope-note">The goal: useful models on your hardware, with less manual tuning.</p>
    <a href="#vision" class="text-link vision-link">Explore the vision <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .system-section { padding-block: 64px var(--section-space); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; }
  .system-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .system-description { max-width: 360px; margin-top: 26px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .system-story { padding-top: 42px; }
  .story-lead { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.45; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .story-body { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; margin-top: 21px; max-width: 520px; }
  .connections { display: grid; gap: 24px; margin: 34px 0 0; }
  .connections > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 145px 1fr; gap: 20px; font-size: 12px; }
  dt { font-weight: 500; }
  dd { margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .scope-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 32px; }
  .vision-link { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 10px; }
  @media (max-width: 950px) { .system-section { gap: 40px; } .connections > div { grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; gap: 14px; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .system-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; } .system-story { padding-top: 0; } .story-lead { font-size: 25px; } }
</style>
